{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_05_end","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":11,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-5","storyName":"通往舞会的邀请函","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"祥子从莫菲丝的口中得知睦的梦境并不简单。“睦”在这个梦里得到了自己想要的人生，为此拒绝了尝试拯救她的祥子，将其推下了山崖。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_05","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["丰川祥子","？？？","莫菲丝","卡尔顿们","若叶睦","睦的母亲","“睦的母亲”","“睦”"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_46_g6_rmbtmine.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"nrun","id":9},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"nrun","fadetime":"2","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"呼......呼......唔......！","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_airshiptakeoff","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"machine","id":17},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"machine","fadetime":"1","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":19},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"machine","fadetime":"3","id":20},{"type":"text","text":"沉闷的声音在空旷的洞穴中回荡，那是附近仍未停止作业的掘地机发出的声响。","id":21},{"type":"text","text":"气温越来越低。","id":22},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"charslot","id":26},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":30},{"type":"text","text":"跑出洞穴的那一刻，寒意同时到来。","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"而寒冷，只会让她心脏的跳动不断加快。","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我该......该怎么面对她？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"charslot","id":36},{"type":"text","text":"无法开口，无法面对。","id":37},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"啧啧啧，该如何是好呢？","id":39},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"o","id":41},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"2","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"无须回头，她已然知道来者是谁。","id":44},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","duration":"0.7","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":47},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":48,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"这个孩子的梦境，我真的很满意呢~","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"梦城堡的职责就是让每个孩子都有一场好梦，我一一实现了她的愿望。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"没想到这个梦境意外地运行得很稳定——不，甚至完美无缺，完全超出了我的预期。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"而且在这里，有一些很有趣的事情正在发生哦。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......你在欺骗她。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"不不不，这可不算欺骗。我和她交易了很多次，她很清楚我的身份。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"看到这个结果，我也很开心呢。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"就算意识到是梦境，依旧不愿意离开，那不正说明我的造梦技艺无人能比吗？","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_1","volume":"1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（赞同的哼唧声）","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":64},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","duration":"1","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哦，最后来的竟然是......？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"有点意思。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我就不打扰你们了~丰川祥子，相信你很快也会发现这个梦境的有趣之处。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shdwblwvr","volume":"0.6","id":76},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥子，大家都在等着你呢。回去吧。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"回哪去？","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你看着莫菲丝消失，却没有一点惊讶......？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"当然。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"这里的一切，都是我们虚构出来的。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"“我们”？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"你，不属于我们。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_65_g9_warmrabbitnest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_electricguitar","volume":"0.6","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cheer_street","volume":"0.8","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"小睦，你弹得好棒！","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"不对，妈妈......祥，她去哪了？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-16$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"小祥？可能去别的什么地方了吧......？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#6$3","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"不对，不对。祥......祥她不可能丢下我。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":118},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":121},{"type":"text","text":"欢呼的人群突然变得一片死寂，所有人都直勾勾地盯着睦。","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"小睦，你好像忘记了——","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"睦的母亲","text":"这里不是你一个人的梦。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1939_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":133},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":134,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦的母亲”","text":"这里是“我们”的梦。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"charslot","id":139},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"“我们”。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"在这个梦境里，每一个“睦”都有机会实现自己的愿望。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"我们和小睦一起，构建出了只属于我们的美梦——大家都能得到幸福的梦。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"我们在小睦的脑海中存在，观看了无数遍她的人生。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"最后，我们一致认为，对于所有的“睦”来说，这就是最好的结局——","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"而你，丰川祥子，你是这个美梦的敌人。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦，你这是在说什么？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我也不希望你痛苦下去，但是我们都不该躲在这样的梦里——","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"......","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"不，小睦能在这里幸福地生活下去才是最重要的事。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"我和大家不一样，我想和祥子好好谈谈。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"你可以留在这里，和我一起，守护小睦的美梦。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-10$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"小睦是一个脆弱的孩子，她可能还无法决定，到底是醒来，还是就这样幸福下去。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"只要你也选择留在这里，帮我们一起让这个梦一直做下去，那它自然就会变成“现实”。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"你是“现实”唯一的基准，你即“现实”。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-14$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"所以，留下来吧，祥子。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-13$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我拒绝。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#5$3","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"你......拒绝？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦现实中的身体正躺在冰冷的梦城堡里，你觉得这样的结局也是好的吗？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你真的足够爱她的话，就不会做出这样的事情。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"只要能让小睦开心，只要我们都能存在——是不是现实又有什么关系？！","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"我拥有小睦的所有记忆，我知道你心里最需要什么！","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"只要你愿意留在这里，我甚至能给你一个完整的Ave{@nbs}Mujica！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"闭嘴！你根本就不是睦......睦不会这样说话。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#11$3","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"我喜欢你，也喜欢小睦......","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-11$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"你为什么要让我陷入两难？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-11$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"charslot","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“动手。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":187},{"type":"subtitle","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"莫名的声音盘旋在两人的头顶上。","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“动手，动手，动手。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":196},{"type":"subtitle","id":197},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":199},{"type":"text","text":"远方的山脉好像在震动，地上的碎石也有节奏地跳动了起来。","id":200},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“动手。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":204},{"type":"subtitle","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":207},{"type":"text","text":"周围明明没有其他人，可祥子却觉得好像有无数双眼睛正在盯着自己。","id":208},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“动手——”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":212},{"type":"subtitle","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#12$3","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"他们说得对。我们对于小睦来说，就是无数的影子。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"为了让影子能一直躲在黑暗里，再微弱的光也要掐灭。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"“睦”一点点将祥子逼到了悬崖边。","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":225},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#5$2","duration":"0.5","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......你要做什么？！","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#12$3","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"祥子......","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4183_mortis_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"“睦”伸出了手，将手放在了祥子的肩上。","id":235},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":237,"musicid":3},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":238},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_65_i08.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","fadetime":"0","x":"150","y":"-40","id":242},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"150","yFrom":"-40","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"30","block":"false","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":245},{"type":"text","text":"祥子失去了平衡，“睦”离她越来越远。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"祥子，我想要小睦一直快乐下去，我也想要所有的“睦”都不再消失。","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"可是我没有办法......","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"小睦，不需要你了。","id":249},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"sticker","id":253,"text":"“求求你，从此再也不要放开——”","x":"300","y":"300","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","duration":"1","width":"700"},{"type":"sticker","id":254,"text":"“永永远远，再也不要放开”","x":"300","y":"380","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","duration":"1","width":"700"},{"type":"sticker","id":255,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":256,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":257},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"永别了，祥子。","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"image","id":265},{"type":"charslot","id":266}],"characters":["丰川祥子","？？？","莫菲丝","卡尔顿们","若叶睦","睦的母亲","“睦的母亲”","“睦”"]}